description.narrative:
The stated objective of the SOL-project is to:

• Increase energy access through innovative private sector provision of, and investment in, off-grid clean energy (eligible technologies: Green Mini-Grids, Solar Home Systems and electrical appliances, Clean Cooking solutions); 

• Accelerate the market development of off-grid energy businesses able to operate sustainably. The private sector businesses should have the potential to attract new sources of finance and exponentially grow their businesses to provide more affordable, cleaner energy solutions to millions more off-grid Mozambicans;

• Support the capacity development of relevant public institutions to steer the sector, strengthen and update the regulatory framework and its operationalization, to support off-grid business initiatives financially and technically; and

• Establish the program as a local sustainable vehicle, based on proven standard operating procedures (SOPs), leveraging further development partner and commercial

For some of these objectives, the implementation will be limited to the provinces of Niassa, Tete, and Zambezia.
